36:42.577 --> 36:44.119
Ini tongkat latihan saya.

36:44.120 --> 36:45.871
Saya harap anda menikmatinya.

36:45.872 --> 36:48.123
Terima kasih, Remy.
Boleh saya peluk?

36:48.124 --> 36:51.169
[sorak dan tepukan]

36:54.255 --> 36:55.506
awak hebat.

36:55.507 --> 36:56.883
Terima kasih banyak-banyak.

36:57.008 --> 36:58.425
Semua orang, Remington.

36:58.426 --> 37:01.388
[sorak dan tepukan]

37:11.189 --> 37:12.815
Nah, hello.

37:12.816 --> 37:15.860
[sorak dan tepukan]

37:19.364 --> 37:20.573
