38:20.467 --> 38:27.349
♪ ♪

38:40.945 --> 38:43.614
- Selepas rehat,
persembahan yang menakjubkan

38:43.615 --> 38:46.451
<i>dari Teater Gershwin
apabila Ariana dan Cynthia</i>

38:46.576 --> 38:49.662
Sertai Stephen Schwartz
